      "tool": "sme_website_copy_refresher_decision",
      "prompt": "Create a pragmatic owner decision plan for headline clarity, benefit language, proof-backed claims, calls to action, and unverified claims. Include the recommended decision, rejected alternatives, first 72-hour actions, owners, metrics, and review triggers. Keep advice bounded by the provided facts and mark anything that needs finance, legal, safety, or compliance review. Return JSON only.",
      "tooling": {
